This copy was modified on 2026-11-23 for BestSnap:

  - Removed every cloud host SDK call site (file system, key-value store, auth,
    workers, AI chat, text-to-image, text-to-video, speech, review sharing)
    and the corresponding UI (sign-in, profile, share, AI assistant, generate,
    script-to-video, cloud restyle).
  - Removed the third-party cloud script tag and any network calls to that host.
  - Captions / speech-to-text go through BestSnap's on-device Whisper via a
    local WebView2 (or Electron) host bridge.
  - Projects stay in this browser's origin-private file system; export uses a
    host save dialog and never talks to a cloud drive.
  - Window title is "BestSnap Video Editor" / 「视频编辑」. About still says
    "Based on Video Studio (AGPL-3.0)".

The rest of BestSnap remains Apache-2.0. This folder is AGPL-3.0-only.
Redistribute the LICENSE next to the built editor, as the installer does.
